    - rid: 3836485838366310464
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 10314665984
    m_Localized: "Ok, remember: {0} to walk, {1} to run. \n\nNow relax and try to
      reach the center of the theater. Try not to trip immediately."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3836485838366310464
  - m_Id: 29595274137600
    m_Localized: 'Remember: {0} to collect the missive.


      I shall carry <b>only
      one</b> at a time. But make haste! The audience is not known for its patience.
      And above all: <color=#7B1A1A><b>never collide with the guests</b></color>!
      Offending a noble is an unpardonable affront that would cost me my position
      in a heartbeat.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3836485838366310464
  - m_Id: 31288808263680
    m_Localized: 'Crucial Note: Relight the extinguished lamps!

      Run to the
      marked area and use {0} on the candles.


      Every moment of darkness makes
      the audience vanish like mist in the sun.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3836485838366310464
  - m_Id: 31270575624192
    m_Localized: 'Note: Beware of the nobles!


      Drop everything and use {0}
      to lead them to their chambers.


      High-ranking guests bring larger crowds.
      Do not keep them waiting!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3836485838366310464
  - m_Id: 31299138834432
    m_Localized: 'It seems I have accounted for every last detail. The grand debut
      is finally upon us, and the curtain is about to rise! May fortune favor me,
      and may the lights stay lit...


      <color=#7B1A1A><i>Merde! Merde! Merde!</i></color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
